  "description": "Zero-boilerplate Scalar wrapper for ASP.NET Core. Configures OpenAPI, API Versioning and Authentication (JWT with HMAC, RSA, ECDSA, OIDC/JWKS or async/KMS signing, Basic, API Key) in a few fluent lines, applies XML documentation comments automatically, standardizes errors as RFC 9457 problem details, with built-in documentation UI protection, a development login endpoint and configuration-based validators.",
